# Keep the Docker build context small + the build fast/reliable.
# Without this, `docker build … .` ships the whole repo (multi-GB Rust
# `target/` + node_modules) to the daemon and can time out
# ("context deadline exceeded"). The always-on/Dockerfile only needs the
# Cargo manifests, engine/, the two app/ crate manifests, and
# ui/agent-schemas/ — everything below is irrelevant to it.
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.context/
.claude/
dist/
**/dist/
website/
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
*.dmg
*.app
*.png
*.svg
